            <note corresp="#d148-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d148-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 684A.85322/3–156. Secret. Received at
                    11:39 a.m. Repeated to Beirut, Cairo, Damascus, London, Tel Aviv, Baghdad,
                    Jerusalem, Jidda, and Paris.</p>
            </note>
